      {
        "id": "patent-stream-note",
        "name": "Streaming Boundary",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          -650,
          -300
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "width": 800,
          "height": 230,
          "content": "## Local candidate — deploy node package before this workflow\nInstall custom-nodes/n8n-nodes-patent-research into the reviewed n8n runtime. Reuse the existing USPTO Header Auth credential; do not put its value in expressions.\n\nCaps each body as chunks arrive (10 MiB maximum), enforces a single 60-second deadline, checks actual MIME/length/signature, rejects nonpublic DNS and pins the resolved IP. Follows one exact USPTO signed redirect without the API key. Signed URLs never become node outputs. At most two in-flight originals per process; no automatic retries.\n\nReturns the same identity-bound PDF/DOCX envelope. No normalization, corpus indexing or legal verification is implied."
        }
      }
    ],
